text = "[center][color=#F5C451][font_size=32][b]⚔ TECHQUEST ⚔[/b][/font_size][/color]
[color=#55CFFF][font_size=24][b]✦ GAME TUTORIAL ✦[/b][/font_size][/color]
[color=#FFFFFF][i]Your Adventure Begins Here![/i][/color][/center]

[color=#4DD9FF]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/color]

[center][color=#FFD166][font_size=22][b]🌟 WELCOME, ADVENTURER! 🌟[/b][/font_size][/color][/center]

Welcome, Adventurer! Your journey starts here. Explore the academy, meet characters, complete quests, and discover new challenges along the way!

[color=#4DD9FF]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/color]

[color=#55CFFF][font_size=22][b]🗺 ADVENTURE GAME[/b][/font_size][/color]

In Adventure Mode, you can explore the map, walk, jump, interact with NPCs, play mini-games, and answer quizzes.

[color=#7CFFB2][b]✦ Your Mission:[/b][/color]
Explore the academy and discover what awaits you!

[color=#4DD9FF]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/color]

[color=#55CFFF][font_size=22][b]🎮 LEARN THE CONTROLS[/b][/font_size][/color]

Move your character around the map, find NPCs, and discover quest locations.

[color=#FFD166][b]⌨ MOVEMENT KEYS[/b][/color]

[color=#7DC8FF][b]  [ A ] / [ ← ][/b][/color]  Move Left
[color=#7DC8FF][b]  [ D ] / [ → ][/b][/color]  Move Right
[color=#7DC8FF][b]  [ SPACE ][/b][/color]  Jump

[color=#7CFFB2][i]Master the controls and prepare for your adventure![/i][/color]

[color=#4DD9FF]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/color]

[color=#C6A0FF][font_size=22][b]💬 TALK TO NPCs[/b][/font_size][/color]

Approach an NPC and interact with them to discover their challenges. Complete their challenges to earn rewards and make progress in your adventure.

[color=#FFD166][b]💡 ADVENTURER'S TIP[/b][/color]
[color=#FFF0A6]Pay attention to the NPC's instructions so you know what to do![/color]

[color=#4DD9FF]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/color]

[color=#FFD166][font_size=22][b]📜 COMPLETE YOUR QUESTS[/b][/font_size][/color]

Open your Quest Menu to view your objectives and track your progress. Complete the required activities, interact with NPCs, play mini-games, and collect the required coins and points.

[color=#7CFFB2][b]★ QUEST OBJECTIVE ★[/b][/color]
Keep completing your objectives to finish your quests!

[color=#4DD9FF]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/color]

[color=#FF9D66][font_size=22][b]🕹 PLAY MINI-GAMES[/b][/font_size][/color]

Take on mini-games to test your skills! Follow the instructions for each challenge, complete its requirements, and earn rewards.

[color=#FFD166][b]🏆 CHALLENGE YOURSELF![/b][/color]
Improve your skills and enjoy every mini-game!

[color=#4DD9FF]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/color]

[color=#C6A0FF][font_size=22][b]❓ QUIZ GAME[/b][/font_size][/color]

Look for quiz challenges around the map and test your knowledge by answering questions.

[color=#7CFFB2][b]✦ Earn rewards by answering correctly! ✦[/b][/color]

Continue your learning adventure and prove your knowledge!

[color=#4DD9FF]━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━[/color]

[center][color=#FFD166][font_size=26][b]🏆 YOU'RE READY TO BEGIN! 🏆[/b][/font_size][/color]

[color=#FFFFFF]Explore the academy, complete challenges, help NPCs, and become a TechQuest champion![/color]

[color=#55CFFF][font_size=20][b]⚔ GOOD LUCK, ADVENTURER! ⚔[/b][/font_size][/color]
[color=#7CFFB2][i]Your quest begins now![/i][/color][/center]"
fit_content = true
